		  Aged, Aged, 80 and over, Cognition
		  Disorders/*physiopathology, Prospective Studies},
  pages		= {1496--8},
  annote	= {Camicioli, RHowieson, DOken, BSexton, GKaye,
		  JengAG08017/AG/NIA NIH HHS/Clinical TrialResearch Support,
		  Non-U.S. Gov'tResearch Support, U.S. Gov't,
		  Non-P.H.S.Research Support, U.S. Gov't, P.H.S.Neurology.
