		  Hypokinesia/diagnosis/etiology/physiopathology, Movement
		  Disorders/*diagnosis/etiology/*physiopathology, Muscle
		  Rigidity/diagnosis/etiology/physiopathology},
  pages		= {1696--703},
  annote	= {Scarmeas, NAlbert, MBrandt, JBlacker, DHadjigeorgiou,
		  GPapadimitriou, ADubois, BSarazin, MWegesin, DMarder,
